Package: mlcenter
Title: Centering in Multilevel Data
Version: 1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Dominik", "Vollbracht", , "dominik@vollbracht.email", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This lightweight package contains functions for centering multilevel data. This applies to group mean centering at level 1 (or person mean centering if data points are nested in persons) and grand mean centering at level 2.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
